          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Climb aboard the Big Bus and get ready for a cozy trip into the night! In this relaxing bedtime story, you’ll hop onto a warm, comfy double-decker that’s about to travel through the snowy night.\n\nHelp get everything ready: pressing buttons, pulling handles, and even turning off the outside lights, before snuggling in your soft bed.\n\nIt’s the perfect way to relax and drift off to sleep, with the soft whirr of the bus keeping you company as you travel hundreds of miles into the night. After the story, the sound of the bus engine will continue playing for a whole hour, helping you stay calm and cozy until you’re fast asleep.\n\nVoiced by Harriet Blackamore, Sound Design by Claire Bilyard at Portland Audio, Written and Produced by Neil Mossey.",
